msgid "Auto-learn builds itself from real traffic — no setup needed. Cloudflare/Local can be scanned manually below."
msgstr "L'auto-apprentissage se construit à partir du trafic réel — aucune configuration requise. Cloudflare/Local peuvent être analysés manuellement ci-dessous."

